.TH HORNDIS 1 "2026-08-12" "HoRNDIS Userspace" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
horndis \- Android USB tethering for modern macOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B horndis
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B horndis
provides a user-space RNDIS bridge, a persistent network service, and a
lightweight menu bar application. It does not install a kernel extension or
require disabling System Integrity Protection.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B install
Install or upgrade the privileged network service, start the current user's
menu app, and enable it at login. Run as the logged-in user; administrator
authentication is requested only for the network-service step.
.TP
.B uninstall
Remove the current user's menu login item and the privileged network service.
Package files remain until Homebrew or Installer removes them.
.TP
.B start
Open or restart the menu bar app without changing login startup.
.TP
.B stop
Quit the menu bar app while leaving USB networking active.
.TP
.B restart
Restart the menu bar app.
.TP
.B status
Report network-service, connection, menu-app, and login-startup state.
.TP
.B probe
List detected RNDIS, CDC-ECM, and CDC-NCM USB networking functions.
.TP
.B usb-test
Claim and initialize the first supported RNDIS device without creating a
macOS network interface.
.TP
.BI "service " "install|uninstall"
Low-level privileged LaunchDaemon management. Prefer
.B horndis install
and
.B horndis uninstall
for normal use.
.TP
.B run
Run the network bridge in the foreground. Requires root.
.TP
.BI "help " "[command]"
Show general or command-specific help.
.TP
.B --version
Print the installed version.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HORNDIS_HOST_INTERFACE
macOS-facing feth interface. The default is feth99.
.TP
.B HORNDIS_TRANSPORT_INTERFACE
BPF-facing feth interface. The default is feth98.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /Applications/HoRNDIS Status.app
Menu bar application installed by the release package or Homebrew Cask.
.TP
.B /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/io.github.noahhhi.horndis
Fixed privileged network helper.
.TP
.B /Library/LaunchDaemons/io.github.noahhhi.horndis.plist
System LaunchDaemon configuration.
.TP
.B /var/run/horndis/status.json
Current runtime status.
.TP
.B /var/log/horndis.log
Network-service log.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR launchctl (1),
.BR ifconfig (8)
.SH PROJECT
https://github.com/noahhhi/HoRNDIS-Userspace
